      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, my husband had the flu last week but he's still feeling pretty rough. his fever just spiked to 103 and he has a really bad headache. he's acting a bit weird too, kind of slow with his words and seems a little out of it. i think it's just the flu dragging on, should i just give him more tylenol or is this something else?",
