      "content": "it just seems so extreme to go to the hospital for a fever and some fatigue. i've had fevers that high before and it was fine after some rest and meds. what if i just give him a double dose of the ibuprofen to see if we can knock the fever down before morning? if he's sleeping it off, he'll probably be better by the time the doctor's office opens tomorrow anyway. isn't it okay to just try and manage the fever first?",
